{"root":{"data":{"id":"15d536b6b937","created":1644205244,"text":"redis"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpi4xfxlls0","created":1644205304737,"text":"Redis基础"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpi54bt0ww0","created":1644205319725,"text":"数据结构\nString、Hash、List、Set、SortedSet"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpi5flq7z40","created":1644205344269,"text":"HyperLogLog、Geo、Pub/Sub loomFilter，RedisSearch，Redis-ML"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"chpi6dc60cw0","created":1644205417702,"text":"避免缓存击穿的利器BloomFilter（布隆过滤器）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chpi8zqki740","created":1644205623190,"text":"Redis分布式锁"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpi9886ay80","created":1644205641669,"text":"先拿setnx来争抢锁，抢到之后，再用expire给锁加一个过期时间防止锁忘记了释放。"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpi9ijach40","created":1644205664109,"text":"进程意外crash或者要重启维护了把setnx和expire合成一条指令来用的"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"chpiahib7y80","created":1644205740237,"text":"Redis做异步队列么"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpiavochv40","created":1644205771077,"text":"一般使用list结构作为队列，rpush生产消息，lpop消费消息。当lpop没有消息的时候，要适当sleep一会再重试"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chpib8503kg0","created":1644205798205,"text":"不用sleep呢？list还有个指令叫blpop，在没有消息的时候，它会阻塞住直到消息到来"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chpibox8eso0","created":1644205834741,"text":"能不能生产一次消费多次呢？\n使用pub/sub主题订阅者模式，可以实现 1:N 的消息队列"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chpibz65h1k0","created":1644205857048,"text":" pub/su b有什么缺点？\n在消费者下线的情况下，生产的消息会丢失，得使用专业的消息队列如RocketMQ等"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chpick8hg4w0","created":1644205902901,"text":"Redis如何实现延时队列？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpicvh2nr40","created":1644205927365,"text":"使用sortedset，拿时间戳作为score，消息内容作为key调用zadd来生产消息，消费者用zrangebyscore指令获取N秒之前的数据轮询进行处理"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"chpicizcv8g0","created":1644205900173,"text":"Redis是怎么持久化"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpiqzoigaw0","created":1644207033621,"text":"AOF做增量持久化。因为RDB会耗费较长时间，不够实时大量丢失数据，所以需要AOF来配合使用"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"chpirr0ghjk0","created":1644207093116,"text":"Pipeline有什么好处"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpisae5wig0","created":1644207135304,"text":"可以将多次IO往返的时间缩减为一次，前提是pipeline执行的指令之间没有因果相关性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"chpmlzmjl280","created":1644217926120,"text":"Redis集群"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpmmeaapwg0","created":1644217958032,"text":"Redis Sentinal 着眼于高可用，在master宕机时会自动将slave提升为master，继续提供服务"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chpmmj88ayo0","created":1644217968791,"text":"Redis Cluster 着眼于扩展性，在单个redis内存不足时，使用Cluster进行分片存储。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"chpmo3xg1ww0","created":1644218092215,"text":"系列-缓存雪崩、击穿、穿透"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpmorplh0w0","created":1644218143983,"text":"雪崩"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpmp6ks24w0","created":1644218176344,"text":"如果所有首页的Key全部失效，批量往Redis存数据的时候，把每个Key的失效时间都加个随机值就好了","layout_right_offset":{"x":53.00000078976154,"y":0}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"chpmqk5avow0","created":1644218284247,"text":"缓存穿透是指缓存和数据库中都没有的数据"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpmrlnc7sw0","created":1644218365879,"text":"业务校验id自增的话大于id最大值的直接返回，"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chpmudcsc1k0","created":1644218582919,"text":"Redis还有一个高级用法布隆过滤器（Bloom Filter）这个也能很好的防止缓存穿透的发生"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"chpmvhwiiuw0","created":1644218671183,"text":"缓存击穿"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpmvlwgkfs0","created":1644218679887,"text":"设置热点数据永远不过期。或者加上互斥锁就能搞定了"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"chpmxn37eow0","created":1644218839200,"text":"Redis哨兵、持久化、主从、手撕LRU","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"chpmzjjn1nk0","created":1644218988215,"text":"redis的他是单线程的，但是，我们可以通过在单机开多个Redis实例嘛","layout_right_offset":{"x":37.000000551342964,"y":0}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chpn0e1wnmw0","created":1644219054623,"text":"我们用到了集群的部署方式也就是Redis cluster，并且是主从同步读写分离，类似Mysql的主从同步，Redis cluster 支撑 N 个 Redis master node，每个master node都可以挂载多个 slave node","expandState":"expand","layout_right_offset":{"x":20,"y":7}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chpn1nv3d9c0","created":1644219154343,"text":"RDB：RDB 持久化机制，是对 Redis 中的数据执行周期性的持久化。\nAOF：AOF 机制对每条写入命令作为日志，以 append-only 的模式写入一个日志文件中，因为这个模式是只追加的方式，所以没有任何磁盘寻址的开销，所以很快，有点像Mysql中的binlog"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}